flow Serde
note """
The SERIALIZATION fixture. Its state block declares a type gob silently drops
and a plain named struct that needs registration, which are carry-in (h)'s two
seeds. It is otherwise a well-formed flow, so any refusal it draws is about
serialization and nothing else.
"""
state {
  ledger Ledger
  memo Note
}
on error Alert
source ingest Feed()
transform tally Count from ingest
  reads ledger, memo  writes ledger, memo
sink emit Report from tally
